{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1247953-exalted-insulting-epithets","id":1247953,"title":"Exalted insulting epithets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-20T01:54:13-07:00","id":1247953,"title":"Exalted insulting epithets","content":"So I've been thinking of different ways of insulting Lunars, so....<br /> <br /> Yeah. <br /> <br /> Any curses or insults or insulting names one calls exalts they particularly hate? Or any particular splat?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T02:52:07-07:00","id":1247962,"title":"","content":"There aren't really enough Celestial Exalted out there for Exaltation-based insults to be all that meaningful, but The Immaculates have names for the Anathema in their fables:<br /> <br /> Forsaken<br /> Blasphemous<br /> Unclean<br /> Wretched<br /> Deceiver<br /> <br /> Frenzied<br /> Trickster<br /> Ogre<br /> <br /> If you're Night Caste and people have seen your castemark, they call you Wretched and assume you're some kind of murderous demonic vampire. How much more insulting d'ya need?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T04:00:49-07:00","id":1247972,"title":"","content":"There is a particular dragonblood in the 2nd ed corebook I like to call sessile navel gazer. Does that count?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I thank the Devs for the great game of Exalted!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12735-bjornthefellhanded","name":"BjornTheFellhanded","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12735_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"327"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T04:11:07-07:00","id":1247975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BjornTheFellhanded</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1247953-exalted-insulting-epithets?p=1247972#post1247972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a particular dragonblood in the 2nd ed corebook I like to call sessile navel gazer. Does that count?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. <br /> <br /> How about 'Beastfucker' for Lunars using Deadly Beastmen Technique?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-20T05:42:30-07:00","id":1248007,"title":"","content":"I am a fan of &quot;God-fearing&quot; as an insult among Immaculates.","signature":"<hr class=